        <summary>AI-powered personal organiser: capture, AI morning briefing, assistant chat, GTD lists, Pomodoro.</summary>
        <description>Stride is an AI-powered personal organiser. Capture tasks and ideas in seconds, get an AI morning briefing, chat with a built-in assistant (using your own AI provider), and keep GTD lists (Inbox, Next, Waiting For, Someday/Maybe, Projects, Contexts) with a guided weekly review and a Pomodoro focus timer. Works offline with no account, and your data stays on your device. Optional sync through Dropbox, WebDAV, a folder, or a self-hosted server.</description>
